cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "NEXUS-GO: Network-Extended Unified Sequence Embeddings for Gene Ontology Function Annotation"
message: "If you use this software, please cite the VISAPP 2026 article below."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Mauhnoom
    given-names: Yeonatan
    affiliation: "Institute of Computing, University of Campinas (UNICAMP)"
repository-code: "https://github.com/ymauhn/nexus-go"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Protein function annotation by propagating protein language model embeddings over
  protein-protein interaction networks, spanning non-parametric multi-hop diffusion,
  learned graph neural networks (GCN, GAT, GraphSAGE) and their fusion.
keywords:
  - protein function prediction
  - protein-protein interaction
  - graph neural networks
  - protein language models
  - gene ontology
